<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE-Philippine H1 farm sector growth.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Philippine H1 farm sector growth.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Department of Agriculture on Tuesday gave the following breakdown of volume of production in the Philippine farm sector in the first six months of 1997.</p>
<p>SUB-SECTOR	  PRODUCTION IN THOUSAND METRIC TONNES</p>
<p> MAJOR CROPS	1997	   1996	    1995</p>
<p> Unmilled rice    4846.46	4950.92	 4317.34</p>
<p> Corn		 1842.19	1778.09	 1582.60</p>
<p> Coconut	    6015.22	5520.55	 5973.89</p>
<p> Sugarcane	  14967.74     15313.77	10889.24</p>
<p> Banana		1581.13     1521.04	 1539.67</p>
<p> Pineapple	    852.83	845.46	  839.83</p>
<p> Coffee		  58.89	 58.39	   66.44</p>
<p> Mango		  574.97	520.29	   495.05</p>
<p> Tobacco		 63.21	 63.85	    62.63</p>
<p> Hemp		    34.85	 39.23	    34.28</p>
<p>OTHER CROPS</p>
<p> Peanut		 26.43	 25.44	    28.18</p>
<p> Mongo		  19.85	 19.37	     19.48</p>
<p> Cassava		874.91	837.02	    836.60</p>
<p> Camote		 374.61	371.41	    369.02</p>
<p> Tomato		 126.99	124.75	    122.93</p>
<p> Garlic		 19.34	  18.52	     17.09</p>
<p> Onion		  74.75	  73.41	     78.83</p>
<p> Cabbage		44.55	  45.55	     59.57</p>
<p> Eggplant	    101.10	  99.20	     95.36</p>
<p> Citrus		 17.28	  16.06	    17.58</p>
<p> Rubber		 82.77	  80.10	    75.25</p>
<p> Cotton		 5.71	    8.31		7.79</p>
<p> Fibre crops	  24.61	  24.72		24.57</p>
<p> Others	     3893.93	3780.51	    3749.00</p>
<p>LIVESTOCK</p>
<p> Carabao (buffalo)  49.34	 45.60		48.47</p>
<p> Cattle		120.86	114.61	     104.83</p>
<p> Hog		   651.13	617.18	     580.89</p>
<p> Goat		   38.12	 37.74		37.82</p>
<p> Dairy		   4.83	  5.49		 5.78</p>
<p>POULTRY</p>
<p> Chicken		439.34	389.2		341.93</p>
<p> Duck		   23.20	  23.92		22.33</p>
<p> Chicken eggs	109.64	 101.95	     103.33</p>
<p> Duck eggs	    25.57	  26.78		22.89</p>
<p>FISHERY</p>
<p> Commercial	   442.56	442.21	     464.45</p>
<p> Municipal	    477.30	502.58	     530.65</p>
<p> Aquaculture	  547.74	522.79	     498.36</p>
